4.6 Experiment 3: 1D Convolutional Neural Network 
Setup: Bypassing feature engineering completely, the 1D-CNN was trained directly on raw 
IMU time-series windows (shape: N × sample(200) × channel(12)). Squeeze-and-Excitation 
